# Smart Hostel Maintenance System

A Flask-based hostel complaint and maintenance management system for students, staff, and administrators. The application helps manage maintenance requests, automatically assign complaints to relevant staff, track complaint status, and provide a dashboard for operational insights.

## Overview

This project allows:

- Students to submit and track maintenance complaints
- Staff members to view active work and update complaint status
- Administrators to monitor all complaints, assignment flow, and dashboard statistics
- Automated complaint assignment based on staff role and workload
- Feedback collection once a complaint is resolved

The backend uses Oracle Database connectivity via `oracledb`, and the project includes SQL scripts for schema setup and sample data.

## Features

- Student portal for complaint submission
- Role-based navigation for student, staff, and admin
- Complaint tracking with priority levels
- Automatic staff assignment using stored procedures
- Status transition management and audit/history tracking
- Admin dashboard with total counts and category/hostel statistics
- Feedback and closure workflow
- REST-style analytics endpoint: `/api/stats`

## Tech Stack

- Python
- Flask
- Oracle Database
- SQL / PL/SQL
- HTML / Jinja2 templates
- JavaScript for dashboard charts (in templates/static assets)

